{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>下午1時37分，警方指報指尖沙咀重慶大廈有人從高處墮下，消防及救謢員到場，發現一名右肩有紋身的非華裔男子倒卧天井位置，救謢員隨即將仍有知覺的事主，送往伊利沙伯醫院搶救，警方正調查事件原因。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T08:24:03.405431+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":94,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T07:35:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T14:17:33.976084+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T08:17:27.695058+00:00","content_hash":"ae845fec97d8c93594af6cc5732f14c61593b38eab6c22e57f15ef7cad0763ce","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}